      "updated_at": "2016-04-24T01:28:01Z",
      "body": "Either one for the warnings, below is the warning I'm getting.\n\n```\nAI: USRACT_UrlTooLong message:\"url is too long, it has been trucated to 2048 characters.\" props:\"{url:https://localhost:45705/login/callback/#id_token...\n```\n\nOn a side note ( whilst i got you :+1: ) what would recommend be the best method to track time spent on a page? tried the startTrackPage, stopTrackPage calls but that is more around the time it takes to load a page. Would custom events/metric be the best method?\n",
