      "created_at": "2016-04-24T13:43:42Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-04-24T13:43:42Z",
      "body": "You can use telemetry initializer to disable this particular or all warnings from being sent. Separately I opened #174 to make it easier.\nRegarding your other question: manually measuring time spent on page and then using custom metric to record it would be the best option. At this point we are intentionally not investing in out-of-box usage scenarios, and only provide basic tracking of users/sessions that is required for impact analysis. The reason is that AppInsights is about performance and failure diagnostics. For advanced usage we are recommending that customers look into other solutions, such as Google Analytics. However you can use AppInsights to record any metrics, so if you don't require advanced  features, AppInsights client-side instrumentation would be sufficient for both diagnostics and usage.\n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
